  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2021-2026 Chevrolet Suburban / GMC Yukon XL\n(Only Fits with 2nd Row Bucket Seats)\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCustom Fit: These floor mats are fit 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025 2026 Chevrolet Suburban / GMC Yukon XL; 3D laser scanning technology gives full protection to both the front and back\nBuilt For Durability: YITAMOTOR 2021-2026 Chevrolet Suburban / 2021-2026 GMC Yukon XL car floor mats are made from premium TPE material featuring high tensity for great comfort and wear resistance while remaining flexible and user-friendly even in extreme cold or hot environments; Product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or any harmful PVC\nAll Season Protection & Non-Slip: The custom floor mats are uniquely designed channels and raised edges that can effectively trap liquid, debris, snow, mud, and sand to keep your car and shoes clean; Built-in retainer clips firmly grip the mat and prevent slipping when wet\nEasy To Clean: The waterproof floor mats simply shake the dirt out of the textured skid-resistant surface or spray down with a hose; No vacuuming or harsh chemicals are needed for maintenance\nWhy Choose YITAMOTOR: Our floor mats for cars are processed with advanced technology, rendering tailored protection and all-weather guards to your vehicle",
  "highlights": [
    "They securely attach to your vehicle using the original factory clasps, keeping the floor liners firmly in place and preventing unwanted shifting during daily driving.",
    "The raised edges provide maximum vehicle coverage, Floor Liners accurately and completely line the vehicle carpet giving absolute interior protection.",
    "Specially designed channels ensure the liner effectively contain the liquid to keep your vehicle and shoes clean, non-slip design for safe driving."
  ],
